                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b6808000-7515-39e4-b6c3-34c3dfed5f18",
                        "entry_id": "a6f1219a-be2c-3a46-9ac5-3590d40e2aba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "анат. двуглавая мышца плеча, сгибающая руку в локтевом суставе и поднимающая её в плечевом суставе"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5649ff1-aa8c-4e59-94c0-a40c0b90c83b",
                                "sense_id": "b6808000-7515-39e4-b6c3-34c3dfed5f18",
                                "text": "Левин улыбнулся, напружил руку, и под пальцами Степана Аркадьича, как круглый сыр, поднялся стальной бугор из-под тонкого сукна сюртука. — Вот бицепс-то! Самсон!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a3426f68-258d-4c4f-9ff6-166e8c1b7c99",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6f1219a-be2c-3a46-9ac5-3590d40e2aba",
                        "source_sense_id": "b6808000-7515-39e4-b6c3-34c3dfed5f18",
                        "target_lang_word": "biceps",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "biceps",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55ac072b-2aa8-3d4b-91c4-e43add7cd9b4",
                                        "entry_id": "7a39cc4b-c9c4-3fea-97a9-10c650b02d24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any muscle having two heads."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b1af2e1-2d97-424c-a7ab-29adb401b079",
                                                "sense_id": "55ac072b-2aa8-3d4b-91c4-e43add7cd9b4",
                                                "text": "The leg is bent by the action of the flexor muscles situated on the back of the thigh, the chief of these being called the biceps of the leg."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5cd44ad0-de05-32c1-9495-d8f77978b8c6",
                                        "entry_id": "7a39cc4b-c9c4-3fea-97a9-10c650b02d24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Specifically, the biceps brachii, the flexor of the elbow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35839e0d-9037-4865-85d6-deadb7dc2151",
                                                "sense_id": "5cd44ad0-de05-32c1-9495-d8f77978b8c6",
                                                "text": "The arm muscles are the show muscles of the physique. When someone asks to \"see your muscles,\" they are most likely referring to your arms, and more specifically, your biceps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33668280-ae08-3e35-a5fd-dd692660a266",
                                        "entry_id": "7a39cc4b-c9c4-3fea-97a9-10c650b02d24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The upper arm, especially the collective muscles of the upper arm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d2a9aef-c2e0-4a2c-a79b-d55610e778e2",
                                                "sense_id": "33668280-ae08-3e35-a5fd-dd692660a266",
                                                "text": "Today, Stonewall's flexed biceps measure 18 inches around."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19272f1b-20d2-46c3-9fda-60c7b3f970d3",
                                                "sense_id": "33668280-ae08-3e35-a5fd-dd692660a266",
                                                "text": "Biting her lip, she held his biceps for balance and waded farther."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96ce126f-de07-4e23-bd8b-9340def2c2b5",
                                                "sense_id": "33668280-ae08-3e35-a5fd-dd692660a266",
                                                "text": "Odin examined the arm-ring, then pushed it onto his arm, up high on his biceps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf58af40-4182-371f-bfa6-a8ce68c91d35",
                                        "entry_id": "7a39cc4b-c9c4-3fea-97a9-10c650b02d24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A point in a metrical pattern that can be filled either with one long syllable (a longum) or two short syllables (two brevia)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7520640-87d8-486a-a5f9-f38d02481aea",
                                                "sense_id": "cf58af40-4182-371f-bfa6-a8ce68c91d35",
                                                "text": "Also it is advisable to distinguish this ( ˘ ˘ ) — ˘ ˘ — rhythm, where the princeps was probably shorter in duration than the biceps (as in the dactylic hexameter), from true (marching) anapaests, in which they were equal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "618a4b4a-00ea-4f95-ba3a-1ad30ca798dd",
                                                "sense_id": "cf58af40-4182-371f-bfa6-a8ce68c91d35",
                                                "text": "This means that in the metrical sequence[…] recited in ordinary speech rhythm, the princeps occupied a slightly shorter time than the biceps (5:6), and if a long syllable was used to fill the biceps it had to be dragged a little[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3296e64f-3def-4c95-8278-c594896b2885",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6f1219a-be2c-3a46-9ac5-3590d40e2aba",
